## 🔹 GitLab CI — Parallel Jobs
You will learn how to **run parallel jobs in GitLab CI**.

stages:
  - build-test

maven-build:
  stage: build-test
  image: maven:3.8.1-jdk-17
  script:
    - git clone https://github.com/Pathnex/sample-java-app.git
    - cd sample-java-app
    - mvn clean compile
  parallel: 1

maven-test:
  stage: build-test
  image: maven:3.8.1-jdk-17
  script:
    - cd sample-java-app
    - mvn test
  parallel: 1



